 "text": "-->\nValley View Milling - Grain Services\n-->\nGrain Services\nToggle Navigation\nCASH BIDS\nWEATHER\nSIGN UP FOR ALERTS\nGROWER PORTAL\nHOME\nABOUT US\nHOURS & CONTACT INFO\nGRAINS\nGrain Services\nCorn Discount Schedule\nSoybean Discount Schedule\nFEED\nFeed Services\nFORMS\nAll Forms\nKansas Ag Exempt Certificate\nKansas Resale Exemption Certificate\nNebraska Tax Exempt Certificate\nMissouri Tax Exempt Certificate\nIowa Sales Tax Exemption Certificate\nColorado Tax Exempt Certificate\nCredit Application\nCredit Application Opt-Out\nMARKET DATA\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nStandard Charts\nTechnical Charts\nSpread Charts\nNEWS\nAg Market Commentary\nAgWeb\nUSDA Reports\nJOBS\nJob Openings\nVVM Application\nVVT Application\nONLINE PAYMENT\nLogin\nLOGIN\nLogin\nMy Account\n-->\nPrevious\nNext\n-->\n-->\nGrain Services\nWith 5.1 Million Bushels of grain storage, we hope to be able to take in all your grain at harvest time. We strive to keep the lines short and the hours long so you can get in and get out and get back to work. We can keep your corn in Grain Bank, so you can use it in feed. And during the year, we can load corn off the farm to direct ship it.\nCall us at (785) 336-5355 to find out if we can help you, or (785) 336-9043 if you need to sell grain!\n-->\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
